"""Doha happy hour app: offers added/updated in the Nov 2026 audit.

Facts (venue, days, times, prices) come from the sources listed per offer; descriptions are our own words.
Main source: Marhaba Qatar "Happy Hour & Ladies Nights" (updated 11 Nov 2026), plus Time Out Doha 2026 guides
and venues' own pages. Each entry: (venue, place, area, group, type, days, start, end, title, offer,
price, priceText, free, unlimited, notes, url, ar)
type: happy | ladies | food | staff (staff & resident deals: industry nights, ID or resident discounts)
"""

